RESOLUTION - Authorizing approval of a corridor plan for a portion of the Cheyenne
Business Parkway (located on Campstool Road between Burlington Trail and Christensen Road).
Mr. Cook moved to adopt, seconded by Mr. Shanor.  Upon inquiry regarding follow-up information
as discussed at Public Services Committee, Brandon Cammarata, Planning and Development
Director, advised a memo was provided to the governing body outlining additional information
regarding reviewing agencies and staff report comments.  Mike McBride, BHA Design,  advised they
are coordinating communication efforts with businesses in the parkway regarding the trail system.
Upon inquiry, Mr. Cammarata stated if City Council endorses the plan, it will provide the applicant
the opportunity to move forward with a memorandum of understanding for parties involved in
implementation of the plan; clarified staff does not intend to propose amendments to the Unified
Development Code based upon this project, and noted the concept is similar to creating a Planned
Unit Development (PUD) but that a PUD is far more comprehensive.  Motion carried.  Voting “yes”
-- all members of the governing body with the exception of Mr. Roybal and Ms. Williams voting
“no”.  (#5653)
